{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/688696-justice-for-all","id":688696,"title":"Justice for all","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-04T13:53:13-07:00","id":688696,"title":"Justice for all","content":"So, I'm trying to make a Claimed for a new werewolf game. Hoping to open strong by having a seemingly 'good' force have a dark underbelly. To this end, I created <a href=\"http://sheetgen.dalines.net/sheet/42475\" target=\"_blank\">Clayton Truman</a>. I finished his chargen recently and he is doesn't have many details yet. He was build by making a normal Wod template and then following the instructions for the Claimed condition. I was hoping for suggestions, comments, and critiques.<br /> <br /> As far as backstory goes, Clayton was a bit of a brute but had a good heart, intending to be fair and protect the weak. Despite much reading though, his viewpoint remained a little simplistic, easily breaking into a dogma of good and evil. He worked politically, agitating for changing in the town, building friends in the courts, police and mayoral office, as well as contributing to neighborhood watch. He has had some success, reducing street crime.<br /> <br /> The spirit that would claim him was born when he valiantly stopped a mugging. It feed off the essence created by the action, a mixture of justice and Clayton's pride. As Clayton mulled over his heroics and was given accolades by those close to him, who were birds of a feather, the spirit avoided a brief existence and was strengthened enough to reach beyond the gauntlet and fetter upon Clayton.<br /> <br /> Clayton was inspired by his actions, and felt new respect for the 'active citizen'. He founded a society dedicated to Justice, simply called the Just and began to teach things such as self-defence, citizens arrest, and neighborly virtues. The activity in the society created a lot of essence that the spirit fettered to Clayton was uniquely positioned to gorge upon. As it strengthen, it rose in rank and soon started to possess Clayton for short times, extolling his own virtues to the crowd and drinking the essence.<br /> <br /> Clayton was claimed soon after and the combined creature took on an angelic <a href=\"http://images7.alphacoders.com/322/322618.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">appearance</a>*, though most assumed he wore the armor for ceremonial reasons. His society became more cult like, and its members were driven to perform more and more actions of a 'just' nature, reveling in the glory. Soon, the extra essence began to produce a court of similar spirits in the shadow of their HQ.<br /> <br /> Clayton's ban is that he must honor the people's sense of justice, and follow the dictates of the mob if one forms before him. His bane, as a result of his vigilante behavior, are legal texts, either printed or read aloud.<br /> <br /> *sans wings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2003,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2003-tabanese","user":"Tabanese","date":". 10-04-2015, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2003-tabanese","name":"Tabanese","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2003_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T18:48:04-07:00","id":690721,"title":"","content":"You can give the claimed a dread-power to conceal it's most glaringly obvious inhuman traits, because otherwise he would not pass by human for long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T23:22:37-07:00","id":690924,"title":"","content":"That's rather the point of Claimed, they aren't human and cease to look human once they've started manifesting their abilities. If they develop an ability to disguise their true nature it should be in keeping with the nature of the claiming spirit. A spirit of war or violence isn't going to be subtle in it's appearance, and if this spirit is feeding on Essence resonant with Pride and Justice (generated through acts of violence, so add that to the essence resonance) there's a good chance it will have become a magath before it initiated the Claiming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T04:48:07-07:00","id":691038,"title":"","content":"I think Tabanese is sort of side-stepping that by having the Claimed take on the appearance of an armored 'angel' figure, and most of its followers believing it is just wearing the armor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T08:35:58-07:00","id":691288,"title":"","content":"Give the Claimed some kind of mind influencing power that imitates/resembles the Majesty Discipline, that should work just fine for making the subject overlook the unusual appearance. One that creates the Inspired or a similar condition while reinforcing a &quot;divine&quot; impression in the subject works for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","e